Basic description: An allocation letter from All Purpose Shelters Limited regarding shop space allocation.

Expanded:
Name: BOB-OGBONNA UGOCHINYERE MARILYN  
Address: 7B, Tema Street, Wuse Zone 6, Fct- Abuja.  

Dear Sir/Ma,

ALLOCATION LETTER

In consideration of your full payment, I am directed to convey to you an approval for the allocation of shop/space COLDROOM 36 at Wuye Ultra-Modern (BOT) Market subject to the following conditions:

a. Signing of a sales agreement by Developer and shop Purchaser;
b. No structural alteration or additions are allowed in the market without written approval of All Purpose Shelters Limited;
c. Fee so far paid is non-refundable;
d. Individual standby generators are not allowed in the market;
e. Printing business is prohibited in the market;
f. All shop owners/operators are under obligation to settle all statutory charges/levies or taxes passed on to the market by appropriate authorities;
g. Delay of settlement of statutory fees shall attract 2% of the statutory fee for every month of default;
h. All shop owners are under obligation to settle promptly service charges to All Purpose Shelters Limited. Such charges include but not limited to:
i. Maintenance fee;
ii. Security levy;
iii. Generator service;
iv. Packing of refuse;

All Purpose Shelters Limited  
Plot 1110 Idris Gidado Street, Wuye Abuja  
Tel: 08131174365 E-mail: info@allpurposeshelters.com  
Website: www.allpurposeshelters.com

